rsonaname": "Kris", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198050822558/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 4256, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1803, "last_played": 1512885445, "avatar": "10834c2e99c9382e911ed0157b34d8a6ffcdfb92"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is literally the best f2p game I have ever played IMO. There are so many classes to choose from and work your way towards, it ain't even funny. Don't listen to the other reviews that say the grinding is awful, it is what makes the game so damn addictive. One of the best things about the game is that it does not require you to spend money. I have put some money in the game however, only to purchase cosmetic gear (which is only because I obsess over my frames looking as FAB as possible). The main thing that I love about this game has to be the multiplayer. With some other mates to play with, this becomes one of the best co-op experiences I have immersed myself in. The way the classes work together in a team is fantastic. In fact, if the devs put a full retail pricetag on this game I would happily fork over the money in a heart beat. Please do yourself the favour of downloading this completely FREE experience. Get some friends and prepare for hours upon hours of fun gameplay and rewarding progression.", "timestamp_created": 1459465597, "timestamp_updated": 1459465597, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "22168981", "author": {"steamid": "76561198235819668", "personaname": "SodaMas", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wowsocoolmydude/", "num_games_owned": 211, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 18463, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15382, "last_played": 1592631279, "avatar": "c677b727a0d9633a406a993d748a921880ce44d8"}, "language": "english", "review": "0/10 khang26 is a toxic frost player that will make you do whatever he wants you to.\nbut other than that the game is AMAZING if you are having any doubts, trust me, just try it out. The community is also really accepting (except for that khang26 guy dont trust anything he says)(especially in reviews). The devs are also really goood at keeping a stable player-driven-economy. everything in this game can be acquired through gameplay and dedication, even the premium currency (platinum) is aqcuirable through just gameplay. The game is constantly being updated with new content (including ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ ship battles holy ♥♥♥♥) . overall 7/5 would recommend", "timestamp_created": 1459465099, "timestamp_updated": 1531019579, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "22168043", "author": {"steamid": "76561198109313297", "personaname": "Squid", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198109313297/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 22211, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 828, "last_played": 1755012723, "avatar": "9064da1add4af36587d38163879cf8d61d75c2d7"}, "language": "english", "review": "played it a couple times and i squirted", "timestamp_created": 1459460493, "timestamp_updated": 1459460493, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": 